  "description": "ZIJSOC crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 Er8 N28 O60. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 9 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 9 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er6 (Er) has 9 O neighbors; Er7 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er8 (Er) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.707-3.791 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.33-112.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H108Er8N28O60. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
